{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["Adjacent to \"you shall not eat on the blood\" — to אָרְלָה (orlah), to teach that it is forbidden to eat without a blessing, like orlah before clearance (חילול)." "<b>You shall not eat on the blood</b> — and adjacent to it: \"you shall not practice divination\" — that they not divine through eating, in the manner that murderers do, who eat bread over the slain, so that the blood-avengers of the slain not take vengeance."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:05.081172960Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}